<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Certificate of Employment</title>
    <style>
      @font-face {
        font-family: "Liberation Serif";
        font-weight: 400;
        font-style: normal;
        src: url("/certificate-assets/fonts/LiberationSerif-Regular-v2.1.5.woff2") format("woff2");
      }
      @font-face {
        font-family: "Liberation Serif";
        font-weight: 700;
        font-style: normal;
        src: url("/certificate-assets/fonts/LiberationSerif-Bold-v2.1.5.woff2") format("woff2");
      }
      @font-face {
        font-family: "Liberation Serif";
        font-weight: 400;
        font-style: italic;
        src: url("/certificate-assets/fonts/LiberationSerif-Italic-v2.1.5.woff2") format("woff2");
      }
      @font-face {
        font-family: "Liberation Serif";
        font-weight: 700;
        font-style: italic;
        src: url("/certificate-assets/fonts/LiberationSerif-BoldItalic-v2.1.5.woff2")
          format("woff2");
      }
      @page {
        size: 8.5in 11in;
        margin: 0;
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      body {
        -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        print-color-adjust: exact;
      }
      .page {
        position: relative;
        width: 8.5in;
        height: 11in;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #fff url("/certificate-assets/mora-letterhead-v1.jpg") 0 0 / 100% 100% no-repeat;
        font-family: "Liberation Serif", serif;
        font-size: 12pt;
        line-height: 1.15;
        color: #000;
      }
      #letter-body {
        position: absolute;
        left: 1in;
        right: 1in;
        top: 1.7in;
        bottom: 1.25in;
      }
      #letter-body p {
        margin: 0 0 0.8em;
      }
      #letter-body .title {
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      #letter-body ul {
        margin: 0 0 0.8em;
        padding-left: 0.45in;
        list-style: disc;
      }
      #letter-body li {
        margin: 0 0 0.5em;
        padding-left: 0.05in;
      }
      #letter-body .signature {
        margin: 0;
      }
      .sign-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-end;
      }
      .qr {
        width: 0.8in;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 6.5pt;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }
      .qr img,
      .qr .qr-placeholder {
        display: block;
        width: 0.8in;
        height: 0.8in;
        margin-bottom: 2pt;
      }
      .qr .qr-placeholder {
        border: 1px dashed #999;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    
<div class="page">
<div id="letter-body">
<p>To whom it may concern,</p>
<p class="title">Certificate of Employment</p>
<p>This letter certifies that {{honorific}} {{recipient_name}} served as a member of the {{pillar_name}} at MoraSpirit Organization from {{formatDate start_date}} to {{formatDate end_date}}. During this period, {{pronoun_subject}} made outstanding contributions to the organization, consistently demonstrating professionalism, dedication, and a strong commitment to excellence.</p>
<p>{{honorific}} {{recipient_name}} played a key role in MoraSpirit's {{pillar_name}} operations, effectively managing and executing a range of responsibilities, including:</p>
<ul>{{#each general_points}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
{{#if special_points}}
<p>Beyond {{pronoun_possessive}} core responsibilities, {{honorific}} {{recipient_name}} actively participated in pillar initiatives, displaying exceptional leadership and problem-solving skills. {{Pronoun_possessive}} dedication and ability to navigate challenges were instrumental in advancing MoraSpirit's objectives. Some of {{pronoun_possessive}} notable contributions include:</p>
<ul>{{#each special_points}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
{{/if}}
<p>{{Pronoun_possessive}} work consistently exceeded expectations, setting a high standard within the organization. We sincerely appreciate {{pronoun_possessive}} efforts and commend {{pronoun_object}} for the impact {{pronoun_subject}} {{verb "has" "have"}} made.</p>
<p>We extend our best wishes to {{honorific}} {{recipient_name}} in {{pronoun_possessive}} future endeavors and have full confidence in {{pronoun_possessive}} ability to excel in any professional pursuit.</p>
<div class="sign-row">
<div>
<p>Thank you.<br>Sincerely,</p>
<p class="signature"><br>{{signatory_name}}<br>{{signatory_title}}<br>Email: {{signatory_email}}</p>
</div>
<div class="qr">{{#if verify_qr}}<img src="{{verify_qr}}" alt="Verification QR code">{{else}}<div class="qr-placeholder"></div>{{/if}}Scan to verify</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>